<view class="page"
  ><view class="hero"
    ><text class="eyebrow">我的</text><text class="title">账号与隐私</text
    ><text class="subtitle">{{displayName || '超级包菜用户'}} · {{studentIdMasked}}</text></view
  >
  <view class="card status"
    ><view
      ><text class="status-title">教务账号</text
      ><text class="muted">{{studentIdMasked}}</text></view
    ><t-button size="small" variant="outline" bind:tap="relogin"
      >{{loggedIn ? '重新登录' : '去登录'}}</t-button
    ></view
  >
  <t-cell-group
    theme="card"
    style="margin: 0 0 24rpx; box-shadow: 0 12rpx 36rpx rgba(41, 84, 62, 0.07)"
    ><t-cell
      title="本机保存的密码"
      note="{{credentialSaved ? '已在本地保存' : '未保存'}}"
      arrow="{{false}}"
      ><t-button
        slot="right-icon"
        wx:if="{{credentialSaved}}"
        size="extra-small"
        variant="text"
        bind:tap="deleteCredential"
        >删除</t-button
      ></t-cell
    ><t-cell title="刷新课表" note="同步最新课表数据" arrow bind:tap="refreshTimetable" /><t-cell
      title="课表缓存"
      note="{{cacheTime}}"
      arrow
      bind:tap="clearCache" /><t-cell title="隐私政策与用户协议" arrow
  /></t-cell-group>
  <view class="card statement"
    ><text class="section-title">关于超级包菜</text
    ><text class="muted"
      >由学生，为学生。超级包菜不是湖南工业大学官方产品，仅提供经用户授权的教务查询能力。</text
    ><text class="version">SuperHUT Mini 0.1.0</text></view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{loggedIn}}" class="danger-actions"
    ><t-button block variant="outline" bind:tap="logout">退出登录</t-button
    ><t-button block variant="outline" bind:tap="unbind">解绑教务账号</t-button
    ><t-button block theme="danger" variant="text" bind:tap="deleteAccount"
      >注销 SuperHUT 账号</t-button
    ></view
  >
</view>
